questions.question:
$$
\text{ Which among following monomers is used to prepare PVC? }
$$

questions.solution:
High density polythene (or plastic) is prepared by heating ethylene at about $330-350 \mathrm{ K} , under a pressure of $1-2$ atm and in the presence of Ziegler-Natta catalyst.

n \mathrm{CH}_{2}=\mathrm{CH}_{2} \frac{330-350 \mathrm{ K}, 1-2 \mathrm{ atm}}{\text{ Ziegler-Natta catalyst }}+\mathrm{CH}_{2}-\mathrm{CH}_{2} \rightarrow_{n}

high density polythene$

